#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:175
msgid "The constant scalar diffusivity is not a constructor input and has no default: `diffusivity` is `None` until a process whose law uses a constant D calls `set_scalar_diffusivity(value)` after reading its parameters. The setter is the only route; it accepts a real number or a one-element floating tensor (including a live ParameterManager-owned `nn.Parameter`, stored as the same object so a calibration update reaches the attribute and the law together), requires a finite value `> 0` [m2 s-1], and raises `TypeError` (bool, None, string, integer tensor) or `ValueError` (non-finite, non-positive, multi-element) otherwise."
msgstr "常数标量扩散率不是构造参数，也没有默认值：使用常数 D 的过程在读取参数后调用 `set_scalar_diffusivity(value)` 之前，`diffusivity` 为 `None`。此设置方法是唯一入口，接受实数或单元素浮点张量（包括 ParameterManager 持有的实时 `nn.Parameter`，保存同一对象，使校准更新同时作用于属性和过程律），要求值有限且 `> 0` [m2 s-1]；否则抛出 `TypeError`（bool、None、字符串、整数张量）或 `ValueError`（非有限、非正、多元素）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:185
msgid "Key methods are `forward(state, time, dt, **kwargs)`, `boundary_conditions(...)`, `compute_diffusivity_tensor(...)`, and `get_transport_metadata()`. The base boundary method raises `RuntimeError`: a concrete process owns its boundary law (normal distance, face coefficient, supported boundary types) and rejects unknown types and missing boundary values without assuming zero. The base diffusivity method raises `RuntimeError`; a concrete process must declare its own correlation, units, parameters, and validity range. `get_transport_metadata()` reports `transport_type`, `diffusivity`, `peclet_number`, and `has_velocity_field`; medium properties such as tortuosity and porosity are owned and exported by the concrete process that uses them. An unknown transport type raises `ValueError`; a helper that needs D raises `RuntimeError` while it is unset."
msgstr "核心方法为 `forward(state, time, dt, **kwargs)`、`boundary_conditions(...)`、`compute_diffusivity_tensor(...)` 与 `get_transport_metadata()`。基类边界条件方法直接抛出 `RuntimeError`：具体过程负责定义自身的边界律（法向距离、面系数与受支持的边界类型），拒绝未知类型与缺失边界值，不假定缺失值为零。基类扩散系数方法同样抛出 `RuntimeError`；具体过程必须声明自身的经验关联式、单位、参数与适用范围。`get_transport_metadata()` 报告 `transport_type`、`diffusivity`、`peclet_number` 与 `has_velocity_field`；曲折度、孔隙度等介质属性由使用它们的具体过程负责管理并导出。未知输运类型会抛出 `ValueError`；依赖扩散系数 D 的辅助方法在 D 未设置时抛出 `RuntimeError`。"

