#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:262
msgid "`method` declares the temporal semantics selected by a concrete runtime. Neither `method` nor `pattern_type` has a default, and `resample(data, source_dt, target_dt, method, pattern=None)` requires its `method` as well. `source_dt` and `target_dt` remain resolution descriptors, not substitutes for explicit calendar bounds. `pattern_type` names an optional reconstruction profile; it is executable only when a concrete implementation binds that profile to explicit bounds, units, diagnostics, and an independent conservation oracle. A `sum` label alone does not prove mass preservation."
msgstr "`method` 声明具体运行时选择的时间语义。`method` 和 `pattern_type` 均无默认值，`resample(data, source_dt, target_dt, method, pattern=None)` 也必须提供 `method`。`source_dt` 和 `target_dt` 仍是分辨率描述，不能替代显式日历边界。`pattern_type` 指定可选的重建剖面；只有具体实现将其绑定到明确的边界、单位、诊断和独立守恒基准后才能执行。单凭 `sum` 标签不能证明质量守恒。"

