#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:350
msgid "A learnable binding from the Functor's own ParameterManager is held by reference. Module `parameters()`, `state_dict()`, `.to()`, `.double()`, and `to_device()` do not copy, save, or convert it. All holders and the optimizer share the same binding and accumulate gradients there. Registration relocates held bindings in place per key; two registered holders assigned different devices raise `ValueError`, and failed registration rolls relocation back. `parameter_sensitivity` refuses a held binding with `TypeError`; use the manager calibration path and `get_trainable_parameters()` instead."
msgstr "Functor 按引用持有自身 ParameterManager 的可学习绑定。模块的 `parameters()`、`state_dict()`、`.to()`、`.double()` 和 `to_device()` 不复制、保存或转换该绑定。所有持有者与优化器共享同一绑定，梯度也累积到其中。注册时逐键原地迁移绑定；两个已注册持有者分配到不同设备时抛出 `ValueError`，注册失败则回滚迁移。`parameter_sensitivity` 对这种绑定抛出 `TypeError`；应使用管理器校准路径和 `get_trainable_parameters()`。"

