#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:389
msgid "Lifecycle:"
msgstr "Lifecycle（生命周期）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:391
msgid "Construction validates `name` and `config`, loads dependencies, registers validation metadata, and enters `FunctorState.INITIALIZED`."
msgstr "构造过程验证 `name` 和 `config`、加载 dependency、注册 validation metadata，并进入 `FunctorState.INITIALIZED`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:393
msgid "The simulator registers the Functor, checks output ownership, assigns an execution group, resolves graph dependencies, and migrates the device."
msgstr "Simulator 注册 Functor、检查 output ownership、分配 execution group、解析 graph dependency，并迁移 device。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:395
msgid "`__call__` requires `time` and a positive `dt`, preprocesses and validates state, enters `EXECUTING`, invokes `forward`, postprocesses updates, checks local conservation and validation rules, then enters `COMPLETED`. It returns the whole output mapping. The simulator classifies it with `partition_outputs`: state proposals enter the group call's provisional state and commit, `diagnostics.*` and `DERIVED` outputs are ingested as diagnostics, and top-level `ExternalIntent` values are excluded from local conservation and delivered only after the step is accepted. A direct `forward(...)` call skips this lifecycle."
msgstr "`__call__` 要求提供 `time` 和正的 `dt`；它预处理并验证状态，进入 `EXECUTING`，调用 `forward`，后处理更新，检查局部守恒与验证规则，然后进入 `COMPLETED`。它返回完整的输出映射。模拟器使用 `partition_outputs` 对该映射分类：状态提议进入该组调用的临时状态及其状态提交，`diagnostics.*` 与 `DERIVED` 输出作为诊断量接收，顶层 `ExternalIntent` 值不计入局部守恒检查，且仅在该步被接受后才投递。直接调用 `forward(...)` 会跳过这一生命周期。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:404
msgid "A supported runtime failure is recorded and wrapped in `ExecutionError`; the Functor enters `FAILED`."
msgstr "支持的 runtime failure 会被记录并包装为 `ExecutionError`；Functor 随后进入 `FAILED`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:407
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Framework validation in step 3 runs the L1 rules registered from the Functor metadata. It is strict by default: an ERROR or CRITICAL finding fails the call with `ExecutionError`, and no message class is exempt. `config[\"strict_validation\"]` (a bool, default `True`; another type raises `TypeError` at construction) is the only switch: `False` is the explicit opt-in that downgrades those findings, and only into a caller-supplied report. `__call__(..., validation_report=list)` (keyword-only, not passed to `forward`) receives one record per call with findings: `functor`, `time`, `dt`, `strict_validation`, `errors` and `warnings` (each a list of `{\"level\", \"code\", \"message\", \"scope\"}`) and `disposition` (`\"raised\"`, `\"downgraded\"` or `\"passed_with_warnings\"`). A downgrade without a report raises `ExecutionError`, so a downgraded finding is never only a log line. The removed key `strict_validation_errors` raises `ConfigurationError`. The Functor keeps no findings: the simulator passes its run-level report (`RELICSimulator.get_validation_findings()`). The validation context carries a mapping output; a bare tensor output (the `torch.nn.Module` hook contract) names no variables and is passed as `None`."
msgstr "第 3 步框架验证运行由 Functor 元数据注册的 L1 规则，默认严格执行：ERROR 或 CRITICAL 结果使调用抛出 `ExecutionError`，没有豁免的消息类别。`config[\"strict_validation\"]` 是唯一开关（bool，默认 `True`；其他类型在构造时抛出 `TypeError`）；显式设置 `False` 才会降级这些结果，且必须写入调用方提供的报告。`__call__(..., validation_report=list)`（仅关键字参数，不传给 `forward`）对每次有发现的调用接收一条记录：`functor`、`time`、`dt`、`strict_validation`、`errors` 和 `warnings`（后两者均为 `{\"level\", \"code\", \"message\", \"scope\"}` 的列表），以及 `disposition`（`\"raised\"`、`\"downgraded\"` 或 `\"passed_with_warnings\"`）。没有报告却请求降级时抛出 `ExecutionError`，降级结果不会只留在日志中。已删除的键 `strict_validation_errors` 会引发 `ConfigurationError`。Functor 不保存验证结果，模拟器传入运行级报告（`RELICSimulator.get_validation_findings()`）。验证上下文携带映射输出；裸张量输出（`torch.nn.Module` 的钩子契约）没有变量名称，因此以 `None` 传入。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:424
msgid "An invalid name or non-dictionary config raises `ValueError`. Invalid dependency configuration raises the Functor `ConfigurationError`. Durable checkpoint validation and file errors belong to the simulator checkpoint API; Functor state dictionaries follow the standard PyTorch loading contract."
msgstr "无效名称或非 dictionary config 会抛出 `ValueError`。无效 dependency configuration 会抛出 Functor `ConfigurationError`。持久化检查点的验证与文件错误属于 simulator checkpoint API；Functor state dictionary 遵循标准 PyTorch loading contract。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:429
