#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Integer number of internal substeps, at least 1 (a bool, a non-integer or a value below 1 raises at construction, and a value changed afterwards raises at the call).A call over `dt` runs `n` substeps of `h = dt / n`; each substep sees the state advanced by the earlier substeps (an amount by its value, a per-second `ACCUMULATE` rate by its value times `h`). The substep outputs merge by the one merge rule (see `step()`): amounts add, and per-second rates form the time-weighted mean `sum_k q_k h / dt`, so the committed change of a constant rate `q` is `q * dt` for every `n`."
msgstr "内部子步数，必须是至少为 1 的整数（bool、非整数或小于 1 的值在构造时引发错误；构造后改为非法值则在调用时引发错误）。一次 `dt` 调用执行 `n` 个长度为 `h = dt / n` 的子步；每个子步读取此前子步推进后的状态（量按其值推进，每秒速率 `ACCUMULATE` 按其值乘 `h` 推进）。子步输出使用同一合并规则（见 `step()`）：量相加，每秒速率形成时间加权均值 `sum_k q_k h / dt`，因此无论 `n` 为何，恒定速率 `q` 提交的改变量均为 `q * dt`。"

