#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:490
msgid "Recognized scientific keyword arguments are `process_name` and `allometric_scaling`. It also accepts `parameter_manager` through `FunctorBase`. The bridge supplies no generic temperature law: a concrete Functor that needs one implements `temperature_function` (the abstract contract raises until it does). It supplies unit diagnostics and the MRO-safe `get_parameter_value(...)` route to `FunctorBase`. Drivers are state inputs; the bridge has no state/environment merge. A concrete subclass must override `forward(...)`."
msgstr "识别的科学关键字参数为 `process_name` 和 `allometric_scaling`，另通过 `FunctorBase` 接受 `parameter_manager`。桥接类不提供通用温度律：需要温度响应的具体 Functor 实现 `temperature_function`（实现前抽象契约会报错）。桥接类提供单位诊断，以及遵循 MRO 的 `get_parameter_value(...)` 到 `FunctorBase` 的访问路径。驱动量来自状态输入，桥接类不合并状态与环境。具体子类必须重写 `forward(...)`。"

