#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:566
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recognized keyword arguments are `device` and `parameter_manager`; the removed field keywords `field_name`, `units`, `default_value`, `spatial_dims` and `temporal_dependence` raise `TypeError`. A concrete class declares `SPATIAL_DIMS` (see `PhysicalField`) and implements `forward` and `get_value_at`: the bridge supplies neither, so a class without them cannot be constructed. `update_field(...)` delegates through the canonical `FunctorBase.__call__` path. `update_field_to_flux(field_update, dt, field_name)` returns `{field_name: field_update / dt}` for a declared output."
msgstr "识别的关键字参数为 `device` 和 `parameter_manager`；已移除的场关键字 `field_name`、`units`、`default_value`、`spatial_dims` 和 `temporal_dependence` 会抛出 `TypeError`。具体类声明 `SPATIAL_DIMS`（见 `PhysicalField`）并实现 `forward` 和 `get_value_at`：桥接类不提供这两个方法，因此缺少它们的类无法构造。`update_field(...)` 通过规范的 `FunctorBase.__call__` 路径委派调用。`update_field_to_flux(field_update, dt, field_name)` 对已声明输出返回 `{field_name: field_update / dt}`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:575
msgid "The default gradient represents a spatially constant field and returns zeros. `interpolate` and `compute_laplacian` require concrete implementations."
msgstr "默认梯度表示空间常量场，返回零。`interpolate` 和 `compute_laplacian` 必须由具体类实现。"

