msgstr "`ScaleCouplingFunctor`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:580
msgid "Implementation path: `relic.core.functor.scale_coupling_bridge.ScaleCouplingFunctor`"
msgstr "实现路径：`relic.core.functor.scale_coupling_bridge.ScaleCouplingFunctor`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:592
msgid "Recognized keyword arguments are `source_scale`, `target_scale`, `coupling_type`, `conservation_properties`, `device`, and `parameter_manager`. `source_scale`, `target_scale`, and `coupling_type` are required: a missing one raises `TypeError`, and the bridge supplies no default scale or coupling type. Dots in `name` are normalized to `_` characters. `get_namespaced_parameter(...)` provides typed access through the canonical Functor parameter route. `upscale(...)` and `downscale(...)` require an explicit matching payload from the concrete `forward(...)`; a missing payload raises `RuntimeError`. `check_conservation_bridge(...)` is diagnostic and does not commit state."
msgstr "识别的关键字参数为 `source_scale`、`target_scale`、`coupling_type`、`conservation_properties`、`device` 与 `parameter_manager`。其中 `source_scale`、`target_scale` 与 `coupling_type` 为必填项，缺失任一项均抛出 `TypeError`，桥接类不提供默认尺度或默认耦合类型。`name` 中的点号会规范化为 `_` 字符。`get_namespaced_parameter(...)` 通过规范 Functor 参数路径提供带类型访问。`upscale(...)` 与 `downscale(...)` 要求具体 `forward(...)` 返回明确匹配的载荷，缺失时抛出 `RuntimeError`。`check_conservation_bridge(...)` 仅用于诊断检查，不提交状态更新。"

