#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`None` (defaults), a bool (the `enabled` switch), or a mapping with only the keys `CONSERVATION_CHECK_KEYS` of `relic.core.state.manager`: `enabled`, `raise_on_violation`, `rollback_on_failure` (each a bool) and `tolerance` (a finite real within the bounds declared for `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance`, currently `[1e-10, 1e-3]`). `validate_conservation_checks` checks it at construction; another type, an unknown key, or an invalid value raises `ValueError` naming the key and the value."
msgstr "可为 `None`（默认设置）、bool（`enabled` 开关），或仅包含 `relic.core.state.manager` 的 `CONSERVATION_CHECK_KEYS` 所列键的映射：`enabled`、`raise_on_violation`、`rollback_on_failure`（均为 bool）和 `tolerance`（有限实数，位于 `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance` 声明的边界内，当前为 `[1e-10, 1e-3]`）。构造时由 `validate_conservation_checks` 检查；其他类型、未知键或非法值会抛出注明键和值的 `ValueError`。"

