#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Whether the packaged variable contracts are loaded. The default comes from `RELIC_AUTOLOAD_CONTRACT_REGISTRY` (default `1`; `0`, `false`, `no`, or `off` disable it). They are read through `relic.contracts.load_contract_registry()`, strictly and once per process: a missing directory raises `FileNotFoundError`, and a malformed or duplicate contract raises `ValueError` naming the file. Opting out is logged at INFO and turns off the ownership, alias, writer-permission, and increment checks in `apply_updates()`."
msgstr "是否加载随包提供的变量契约。默认取自 `RELIC_AUTOLOAD_CONTRACT_REGISTRY`（默认 `1`；`0`、`false`、`no` 或 `off` 可关闭）。通过 `relic.contracts.load_contract_registry()` 严格读取，每个进程只加载一次：缺少目录时抛出 `FileNotFoundError`，格式错误或重复契约抛出注明文件的 `ValueError`。显式关闭会记录 INFO 日志，并关闭 `apply_updates()` 中的所有权、别名、写入者权限和增量检查。"

