#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`conservation_tolerance` (property)"
msgstr "`conservation_tolerance`（属性）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "The commit-time ledger tolerance. Its default has one source, the parameter `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance` (`CONSERVATION_TOLERANCE_PARAMETER`); a missing parameter raises, with no fallback. An assignment is validated like `conservation_checks[\"tolerance\"]` (a finite real within the declared bounds, currently `[1e-10, 1e-3]`) and an invalid value raises `ValueError` without changing the tolerance."
msgstr "提交时的收支容差。默认值只有一个来源：参数 `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance`（`CONSERVATION_TOLERANCE_PARAMETER`）；缺失时直接报错，不使用替代值。赋值按 `conservation_checks[\"tolerance\"]` 的规则验证（声明边界内的有限实数，当前边界为 `[1e-10, 1e-3]`），非法值抛出 `ValueError` 且不改变容差。"

