#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:777
msgid "`use_networkx` keeps a NetworkX mirror of the graph for introspection; it is never sorted. `topological_sort` has one path, Kahn's algorithm over the declared adjacency, and breaks ties by Functor registration order. A Functor joins the graph under a non-empty string name (or an explicit `functor_id`); otherwise `add_functor` raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "`use_networkx` 保留图的 NetworkX 镜像供内省使用，但不对其排序。`topological_sort` 只有一条路径：在声明的邻接关系上运行 Kahn 算法，以 Functor 注册顺序打破平局。Functor 必须使用非空字符串名称（或显式 `functor_id`）加入图，否则 `add_functor` 抛出 `ValueError`。"

