#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`\"lie\"`"
msgstr "`\"lie\"`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`lie` (sequential) or `strang` (palindromic composition over the whole fast plan order, `2n - 1` sub-executions; the second half-steps start at `t + h/2`). The sub-executions share one dependency-output map: a Functor that declares `subprocess_outputs` sees each provider's most recent earlier sub-execution, which under `strang` is the provider's first half-step over `[t, t + h/2]`. The effective order is the lower of the splitting order and the declared `sub_flow_accuracy` of the fast Functors; see `get_splitting_order_report()` and the numerics theory page."
msgstr "`lie`（顺序执行）或 `strang`（按整个快速计划顺序作回文组合，共 `2n - 1` 次子执行；后半步从 `t + h/2` 开始）。各子执行共享一个依赖输出映射：声明 `subprocess_outputs` 的 Functor 读取各提供者最近一次较早子执行的输出；在 `strang` 下，它读取提供者在 `[t, t + h/2]` 上的第一个半步。有效阶数取分裂阶数与快速组 Functor 声明的 `sub_flow_accuracy` 中较低者；参见 `get_splitting_order_report()` 及数值理论页。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
