msgstr "由参数提供：`transport.numerical.time_integration_method` = `\"euler\"`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Transport time integration method, one of the parameter's `allowed_values` `euler`, `implicit_midpoint`, and `crank_nicolson`; passed to each Functor whose `forward` declares this keyword."
msgstr "输运时间积分方法，取该参数 `allowed_values` 中的 `euler`、`implicit_midpoint` 或 `crank_nicolson`；传给 `forward` 声明此关键字的每个 Functor。"

