msgstr "`resolve_cross_group_deps`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Move `slow` consumers that read outputs of faster groups without a `lagged` declaration into the `medium` group (slow to medium only). A Functor already scheduled in `slow` moves only when both groups last ran at the same time; otherwise the registration is rejected. Fast-group reads do not change."
msgstr "将读取较快组输出但未声明 `lagged` 的 `slow` 使用者移入 `medium` 组（仅从慢组移至中组）。已在 `slow` 调度的 Functor，只有两组上次运行时间相同时才移动，否则拒绝注册。快速组的读取不变。"

