#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Conservation"
msgstr "守恒"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`True` enables and `False` disables StateManager conservation checks; a mapping may set only `enabled`, `raise_on_violation`, `rollback_on_failure` (bools) and `tolerance`. Another type, an unknown key, or an invalid value raises `ValueError`. Inside `step()` the checks run at every group commit (this setting enabled in StateManager and the simulator switch `enable_conservation_checks` true); StateManager's per-commit `generate_conservation_report(...)` is suspended for the step transaction, so an accepted step adds no summary to `conservation_history`. It is a setting, not a feature flag."
msgstr "`True` 启用、`False` 禁用 StateManager 守恒检查；映射仅可设置 `enabled`、`raise_on_violation`、`rollback_on_failure`（布尔值）及 `tolerance`。其他类型、未知键或无效值会抛出 `ValueError`。在 `step()` 内，检查于每次组提交执行（须在 StateManager 启用此设置，且模拟器开关 `enable_conservation_checks` 为真）；StateManager 的逐提交 `generate_conservation_report(...)` 在步事务期间暂停，因此已接受步不会向 `conservation_history` 添加摘要。这是设置，不是功能开关。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`conservation_raise_on_violation`, `conservation_rollback_on_failure`"
msgstr "`conservation_raise_on_violation`、`conservation_rollback_on_failure`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Bool overrides of the same `conservation_checks` keys; a non-bool value (for example `\"false\"`, `0`, `1`) or a value contradicting `conservation_checks` raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "同一 `conservation_checks` 键的布尔覆盖值；非布尔值（例如 `\"false\"`、`0`、`1`）或与 `conservation_checks` 矛盾的值会抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
