msgid "Override of the StateManager commit-time ledger tolerance: a finite real number within the bounds declared for that parameter (currently `[1e-10, 1e-3]`); otherwise `ValueError`. The simulator checks it, like the other conservation settings, with the StateManager rules."
msgstr "覆盖 StateManager 提交时的收支容差：必须是该参数声明边界内的有限实数（当前为 `[1e-10, 1e-3]`），否则抛出 `ValueError`。与其他守恒设置一样，模拟器按 StateManager 规则检查此值。"

