msgid "Nested scale settings."
msgstr "嵌套尺度设置。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`auto_scale.mode`"
msgstr "`auto_scale.mode`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "parameter-backed"
msgstr "由参数提供"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "ScaleManager default mode; its `coupling.scales.defaults.precision.<mode>.tolerance` is the facade ledger tolerance of calls without a mode."
msgstr "ScaleManager 默认模式；其 `coupling.scales.defaults.precision.<mode>.tolerance` 是未指定模式的调用所采用的门面收支容差。"

