msgstr "强制执行考虑 CF 约定的尺度元数据要求。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`auto_scale.source_grid`"
msgstr "`auto_scale.source_grid`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Source grid descriptor. Required, with `auto_scale.target_grid`, whenever a detected scale mismatch triggers automatic regridding and the scale check supplies no grid; missing descriptors raise `ValueError` because geometry is never inferred from tensor shape or scale labels."
msgstr "源网格描述符。检测到尺度不匹配并触发自动重网格、且尺度检查未提供网格时，必须与 `auto_scale.target_grid` 一同提供；缺少描述符会抛出 `ValueError`，因为绝不从张量形状或尺度标签推断几何。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`auto_scale.target_grid`"
msgstr "`auto_scale.target_grid`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Target grid descriptor, a mapping (`TypeError` otherwise). Required, with `auto_scale.source_grid`, whenever automatic regridding runs and the scale check supplies no grid; missing descriptors raise `ValueError`. Unless its geometry entries equal those of the source descriptor exactly (an identity regrid, which returns the state unchanged without any metadata lookup), it must also declare the non-empty strings `grid_mapping`, `lat_name`, and `lon_name` (`CF_REGRID_TARGET_GRID_FIELDS`); they are never inferred. Once the ScaleManager lifecycle has attached its CF synchronizer, during `initialize(...)` or `initialize_state(...)`, a descriptor without them raises `ValueError` naming the missing fields, and the check is repeated before each regrid. Each regridded variable needs a ScaleManager catalog entry (`KeyError` otherwise); its `spatial_basis` selects the method: `nearest` for `categorical`, `conservative` otherwise."
msgstr "目标网格描述符，必须是映射（否则抛出 `TypeError`）。自动重网格执行且尺度检查未提供网格时，须与 `auto_scale.source_grid` 一同提供；缺少描述符会抛出 `ValueError`。除非其几何条目与源描述符完全相同（恒等重网格直接返回原状态，不查询元数据），否则还必须声明非空字符串 `grid_mapping`、`lat_name` 和 `lon_name`（`CF_REGRID_TARGET_GRID_FIELDS`），绝不推断这些字段。ScaleManager 生命周期在 `initialize(...)` 或 `initialize_state(...)` 中接入 CF 同步器后，缺少上述字段的描述符会抛出 `ValueError` 并列出缺项；每次重网格前都会再次检查。每个重网格变量须有 ScaleManager 目录条目（否则抛出 `KeyError`）；其 `spatial_basis` 决定方法：`categorical` 用 `nearest`，其他情况用 `conservative`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "`auto_scale_mode`"
msgstr "`auto_scale_mode`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Flat compatibility key for `auto_scale.mode`."
msgstr "`auto_scale.mode` 的扁平兼容键。"

