#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md
msgid "Validate a `FunctorBase`, output ownership, dependencies, group, and device before registration. The group is resolved before any registration state changes, by one priority chain: the `execution_group` argument, the Functor attribute `execution_group`, `characteristic_time_days`, `metadata.temporal_scale`, the `process_groups` entry, and `fast` when nothing is declared. The argument takes precedence over every other rule, including a conflicting `process_groups` entry. Every declared value is validated, also when a higher rule decides; an invalid value raises `ValueError` and registers nothing."
msgstr "注册前验证 `FunctorBase`、输出所有权、依赖、组别和设备。在任何注册状态改变前，按唯一优先级链确定组别：`execution_group` 参数、Functor 属性 `execution_group`、`characteristic_time_days`、`metadata.temporal_scale`、`process_groups` 条目；均未声明时使用 `fast`。显式参数优先于其他所有规则，包括冲突的 `process_groups` 条目。即使较高优先级规则已确定组别，仍验证所有已声明值；非法值抛出 `ValueError`，且不注册任何内容。"

