#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:939
msgid "Durable checkpoint serialization, validation, rollback, and receipts are owned only by `relic.core.simulator.checkpoint`. There is no implicit checkpoint destination and no public cleanup API. Automatic checkpointing remains disabled unless `enable_checkpointing=True`; that setting requires an explicit `checkpoint_directory` and positive `checkpoint_frequency`. An automatic write occurs only after an accepted scientific/provenance step commit."
msgstr "持久化检查点的序列化、验证、回滚与回执仅由 `relic.core.simulator.checkpoint` 所有。不存在隐式的检查点目标位置，也没有公开的清理 API。除非 `enable_checkpointing=True`，自动检查点保持禁用；该设置要求显式的 `checkpoint_directory` 和正的 `checkpoint_frequency`。自动写入仅在科学/provenance step 提交被接受之后发生。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:947
msgid "The active `relic.simulator.checkpoint` file format requires `format_version=3` and is loaded with `weights_only=True`; only version 3 is written. Each Functor entry contains `state_dict` (including PyTorch extra state) and `parameter_bindings` (live values of manager bindings held by reference, including nested Functors). Restore writes those values through the owning manager without replacing binding identity, gradient flag, or device; live and saved keys, shapes, and dtypes must match. Version 2 is upgraded in memory, with `format_upgrade` in the restore receipt recording `from_format_version`, `to_format_version`, and `moved_bindings`. The payload also binds the StateManager snapshot, scientific/topology contracts, resolved device and distributed signatures, and Python/Torch CPU/optional legacy global NumPy/CUDA RNG states. CUDA RNG presence is symmetric with the resolved runtime. The current single-file contract fails closed when an active distributed runtime has `world_size > 1`. Create and restore receipts contain the resolved path, format version, file size, file SHA-256, and payload SHA-256."
msgstr "当前 `relic.simulator.checkpoint` 文件格式要求 `format_version=3`，并使用 `weights_only=True` 加载；仅写入版本 3。每个 Functor 条目包含 `state_dict`（含 PyTorch 额外状态）和 `parameter_bindings`（按引用持有的管理器绑定实时值，包含嵌套 Functor）。恢复通过所属管理器写回这些值，不替换绑定对象、梯度开关或设备；实时与保存的键、形状和 dtype 必须匹配。版本 2 在内存中升级，恢复回执的 `format_upgrade` 记录 `from_format_version`、`to_format_version` 和 `moved_bindings`。载荷还绑定 StateManager 快照、科学与拓扑契约、解析后的设备和分布式签名，以及 Python、Torch CPU、可选的旧式全局 NumPy 和 CUDA 随机数状态。CUDA 随机数状态的存在性与解析后的运行时对称。当前单文件契约在活动分布式运行时满足 `world_size > 1` 时拒绝操作。创建和恢复回执包含解析后的路径、格式版本、文件大小、文件 SHA-256 和载荷 SHA-256。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:963
msgid "Stochastic Functors that inherit `FunctorSubstreamMixin` -- including the two certified Level 2 (`[I]`) runtime-bound processes `OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` and `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor` -- serialize their independent deterministic substream cursor via PyTorch `get_extra_state()` and `set_extra_state()`, so checkpoint/restart and rejected-step rollback replay identical stochastic realizations without relying on global RNG call order."
msgstr "继承 `FunctorSubstreamMixin` 的随机 Functor（包括两个已认证的 Level 2 `[I]` 运行时绑定过程 `OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` 与 `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`）通过 PyTorch `get_extra_state()` 与 `set_extra_state()` 序列化各自独立的确定性子流游标，从而在检查点保存/重启以及拒绝步回滚时重放一致的随机样本轨迹，无需依赖全局随机数生成器（RNG）的调用顺序。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:971
msgid "`StateManager.checkpoint()` is the full in-memory snapshot embedded in this format and used by the adaptive retry; the accepted-step rollback uses `create_transaction_savepoint()`. Neither is a second durable persistence system. A bitwise-equal continuous/restart experiment is run-specific evidence and is not a general cross-platform or cross-device reproducibility guarantee."
msgstr "`StateManager.checkpoint()` 是嵌入在该格式中、并由自适应重试使用的完整内存快照；已接受步事务中的回滚使用 `create_transaction_savepoint()`。二者都不是第二个持久化系统。逐位相等的连续运行/重启实验只是针对特定运行的证据，并不构成通用的跨平台或跨设备可复现性保证。"

