msgstr "`distributed=True` 时的分布式默认设备（CUDA 可用时为 `torch.device(\"cuda\")`，不可用时回退至 `torch.device(\"cpu\")`），或调用方传入的 `default` 参数（默认为 `\"cpu\"`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1098
msgid "Non-mapping override containers raise `TypeError`, malformed JSON in `RELIC_DEVICE_OVERRIDES_JSON` raises `ValueError`, and unparseable device strings in an override map raise `RuntimeError` naming the source and key. An unavailable CUDA request (`\"auto\"` or `\"cuda\"`) falls back to `torch.device(\"cpu\")` unless `require_gpu=True`, which raises `RuntimeError`. An out-of-range `cuda:N` index falls back to `cuda:0` when at least one CUDA device is visible or `cpu` when none is visible, unless `require_gpu=True` (`RuntimeError`). On `RELICSimulator`, an explicit `enable_distributed: true` request that cannot be met raises `RuntimeError`."
msgstr "非映射类型的覆盖容器会抛出 `TypeError`，`RELIC_DEVICE_OVERRIDES_JSON` 中的非法 JSON 会抛出 `ValueError`，覆盖映射中无法解析的设备字符串则会抛出指明来源与键名的 `RuntimeError`。当请求的 CUDA 不可用（`\"auto\"` 或 `\"cuda\"`）时，除非 `require_gpu=True`（此时抛出 `RuntimeError`），否则回退至 `torch.device(\"cpu\")`。越界的 `cuda:N` 索引在至少有一个可见 CUDA 设备时回退至 `cuda:0`，无可见 CUDA 设备时回退至 `cpu`（设置 `require_gpu=True` 时则抛出 `RuntimeError`）。在 `RELICSimulator` 上，若显式请求的 `enable_distributed: true` 无法满足，则直接抛出 `RuntimeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1122
msgid "`DeviceFence(devices)` records one CUDA event on the current stream of each distinct CUDA device in `devices`; CPU devices are ignored, and a fence without CUDA events is complete. `completed` is true once the work enqueued on those streams before the record has finished. `wait(timeout=None)` blocks until then and returns `False` if `timeout` seconds pass first, and `describe()` returns the devices, the event count, and the completion flag. Work enqueued later or on other streams is not covered. The simulator records such fences for its provider views and releases a retired view only after they complete."
msgstr "`DeviceFence(devices)` 在 `devices` 中每个不同 CUDA 设备的当前流上记录一个 CUDA 事件；忽略 CPU 设备，没有 CUDA 事件的栅栏视为已完成。记录前已排入这些流的任务全部结束后，`completed` 为真。`wait(timeout=None)` 阻塞等待完成，若先经过 `timeout` 秒则返回 `False`；`describe()` 返回设备、事件数量和完成标志。后来排入或其他流上的任务不在此范围内。模拟器为提供者视图记录这种栅栏，只有全部完成后才释放已退役视图。"

