#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1171
msgid "Direct `RELICConfig(...)` construction raises `pydantic.ValidationError` for invalid types, ranges, extra fields, cross-field constraints, or simulation names. A nonmatching major schema version warns. `from_yaml(path)` raises `relic.core.config.loader.ConfigurationError` for every load failure; a wrapped exception, such as a Pydantic error, is kept as its `__cause__`. PyYAML, `toml`, Hydra, and OmegaConf are import-time requirements of `relic.core.config`."
msgstr "直接构造 `RELICConfig(...)` 时，非法类型、范围、额外字段、跨字段约束或模拟名称会引发 `pydantic.ValidationError`。模式主版本不匹配时发出警告。`from_yaml(path)` 对所有加载失败抛出 `relic.core.config.loader.ConfigurationError`，被包装的异常（如 Pydantic 错误）保留为 `__cause__`。PyYAML、`toml`、Hydra 和 OmegaConf 是导入 `relic.core.config` 时的必需依赖。"

