#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1414
msgid "These configuration fields do not auto-compile scientific Functors. The only public callable adapter is `relic.computation.jit.maybe_compile(...)`, which wraps `torch.compile` for one caller-supplied callable. It does not certify arbitrary Python purity or scientific-kernel equivalence. Its numerical validation option is `[N]` and rejects before compilation or callable execution. Synthetic benchmark success is scoped to one current environment, target label, input batch, backend, and device; it is not cross-backend, cross-device, release, or long-integration evidence."
msgstr "这些配置字段本身不触发科学 Functor 的自动编译。唯一公开的可调用编译适配器为 `relic.computation.jit.maybe_compile(...)`，它针对调用方传入的单个可调用对象封装 `torch.compile`。该函数不证明任意 Python 函数的纯度或科学核等价性；其数值校验选项标记为 `[N]`，会在编译或执行可调用对象之前直接拒绝。合成基准测试通过仅代表当前环境、目标标签、输入批次、后端与设备这一组特定条件下的结果，不构成跨后端、跨设备、发布验收或长时积分证据。"

