#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1464
msgid "Each field may be overridden by `RELIC_ENABLE_<FIELD_NAME>=true/false`. The fields are the only flags. The process-wide `relic.core.feature_flags.feature_manager` (`FeatureFlagManager`) accepts exactly these field names in `is_enabled`, `enable`, `disable`, `toggle`, `update_flag`, and `register_callback`; any other name, such as the simulator setting `conservation_checks`, raises `ValueError` and never reads as disabled. `get_all_flags()`, `get_enabled_features()`, `get_disabled_features()`, and `get_feature_status_report()` report the declared flags. The model itself has no name-lookup methods."
msgstr "每个字段均可通过环境变量 `RELIC_ENABLE_<FIELD_NAME>=true/false` 覆盖，这些字段构成了全部合法功能开关。进程级 `relic.core.feature_flags.feature_manager`（`FeatureFlagManager`）在 `is_enabled`、`enable`、`disable`、`toggle`、`update_flag` 与 `register_callback` 中仅接受上述字段名；传入其他任何名称（如模拟器配置项 `conservation_checks`）均抛出 `ValueError`，绝不静默视作未启用。`get_all_flags()`、`get_enabled_features()`、`get_disabled_features()` 与 `get_feature_status_report()` 报告已声明的功能开关；配置模型本身不提供按名称查询的方法。"

