#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1559
msgid "`ConfigValidator`"
msgstr "`ConfigValidator`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1565
msgid "The validator owns an ordered rule list. `add_rule(rule)` rejects duplicate `rule_id` values; `remove_rule(rule_id)` reports whether a rule was removed. `validate(config, levels=None, use_cache=True)` applies the selected `ConfigValidationStage` values and returns a `ConfigValidationResult`. An exception inside a rule is captured as an error message and does not escape the validation pass."
msgstr "该校验器维护一份有序规则列表。`add_rule(rule)` 拒绝重复的 `rule_id`；`remove_rule(rule_id)` 返回是否成功移除了对应规则。`validate(config, levels=None, use_cache=True)` 按选定的 `ConfigValidationStage` 阶段执行检查并返回 `ConfigValidationResult`。单条规则内部抛出的异常会被捕获为错误消息，不向校验流程外部逸出。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1572
msgid "The six default rules, in priority order, are `temperature_bounds`, `timestep_stability`, `conservation_consistency`, `parameter_bounds`, `integration_consistency`, and `memory_usage`. `calendar_type` (`noleap` or `360_day`) is passed to `integration_consistency`. Without it, a simulation longer than 360 days is reported as an error, because that check depends on the calendar year length; with it, a simulation longer than one calendar year gets an `INFO` suggestion to set the runtime key `adaptive_dt_enabled`. `ConfigLoader` constructs its validator without a calendar, so with `validate_on_load=True` such a configuration fails to load with `ConfigurationError`."
msgstr "六条默认规则按优先级依次为 `temperature_bounds`、`timestep_stability`、`conservation_consistency`、`parameter_bounds`、`integration_consistency` 和 `memory_usage`。`calendar_type`（`noleap` 或 `360_day`）传入 `integration_consistency`。未提供日历时，超过 360 天的模拟会报告错误，因为该检查依赖日历年长度；提供日历后，超过一个日历年的模拟会收到建议设置运行时键 `adaptive_dt_enabled` 的 `INFO` 消息。`ConfigLoader` 构造验证器时不传日历，因此启用 `validate_on_load=True` 时，此类配置会因 `ConfigurationError` 而加载失败。"

