#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1624
msgid "`relic.core.DependencyGraph` is an alias of `DependencyGraphResolver`. Direct `add_functor()` raises `ValueError` for an existing node ID but performs no output-owner, bridge, or device check. Use `RELICSimulator.register_functor()` for canonical duplicate-name, output-owner, dependency, and device checks."
msgstr "`relic.core.DependencyGraph` 是 `DependencyGraphResolver` 的别名。直接调用 `add_functor()` 时，已存在的节点 ID 会引发 `ValueError`，但不会执行输出 owner、桥接类或设备检查。规范的重名、输出 owner、依赖和设备检查应使用 `RELICSimulator.register_functor()`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1629
msgid "`relic.core.ConfigurationError` belongs to the Functor exception hierarchy. `ConfigLoader` raises the distinct `relic.core.config.loader.ConfigurationError`."
msgstr "`relic.core.ConfigurationError` 属于 Functor exception hierarchy。`ConfigLoader` 抛出不同的 `relic.core.config.loader.ConfigurationError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1632
msgid "The Functor call forms are `functor(state, time, dt)` and `functor(state, time=..., dt=...)`. Any other positional form (for example an environment mapping after the state), or `time`/`dt` given both positionally and by keyword, raises `TypeError`: scientific inputs come only from the state."
msgstr "Functor 的调用形式为 `functor(state, time, dt)` 和 `functor(state, time=..., dt=...)`。其他位置参数形式（例如在状态后传入环境映射），或同时通过位置与关键字传入 `time` / `dt`，都会抛出 `TypeError`：科学输入只能来自状态。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1637
msgid "Typed and runtime configuration names are not a direct one-to-one mapping: `SimulationConfig.integration_method` corresponds to `time_integration_method`; `SimulationConfig.end_time` corresponds to `run(end_time=...)` and does not map directly to `max_time`. `ComputationConfig.device` defaults to CPU, while `RELICSimulator(config=None)` uses CUDA-first automatic resolution. Convert these fields explicitly at the application boundary."
msgstr "类型化配置字段名与运行时字典键名并非一一直接映射：`SimulationConfig.integration_method` 对应 `time_integration_method`；`SimulationConfig.end_time` 对应 `run(end_time=...)`，不直接映射到 `max_time`。`ComputationConfig.device` 默认为 CPU，而 `RELICSimulator(config=None)` 采用 CUDA 优先的设备解析策略。应在应用边界处显式转换上述字段。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/core_runtime.md:1644
msgid "`FunctorBase` and `RELICSimulator` are `torch.nn.Module` objects, which does not make a run globally smooth. Bound clipping (`torch.clamp`, zero gradient for clipped elements; detached when `preserve_gradients` is false), event and rate-group triggers, adaptive accept/reject and step-size choice, sub-step counts, and detached diagnostic values are not differentiable. Graph node caching never replays autograd-bearing values. Verify gradients on the executed graph before a sensitivity or calibration claim."
msgstr "`FunctorBase` 和 `RELICSimulator` 是 `torch.nn.Module` 对象，但这并不使一次运行在全局上光滑。边界裁剪（`torch.clamp`，被裁剪元素的梯度为零；当 `preserve_gradients` 为 false 时会被分离）、事件与速率组触发、自适应的接受/拒绝和步长选择、子步数量，以及已分离的诊断值均不可微。图节点缓存从不重放携带 autograd 信息的值。在提出敏感性或校准结论之前，应在实际执行的图上验证梯度。"

